<title>UK: Wet Brent trades at Aug +17 cts, date kept.</title>
<headline>Wet Brent trades at Aug +17 cts, date kept.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A wet Brent cargo loading August 7-9 was traded at August Brent +17 cents on Thursday, two cents up on deal done on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Another cargo loading August 8-10 nominated from the paper chains on Thursday was kept by Elf ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
